    "turn_text": "Now, in terms of lean not on your own understanding, as a senator, how apt are people to criticize you? Let's take your life as a senator to your life before a senator. Are people more or less likely to criticize you as a senator? Not the media, but just people in person when they see you. Are you more or less likely the senator versus representative or not in office at all? a state representative or something.",
