    "turn_idx": 22,
    "turn_text": "So how do you think people in any walk of life, whether they're a senator or a constituent doing anything, can best manifest one of the lessons of this proverb where it says lean not on your own understanding, but to receive the understanding of God as often is channeled through the wisdom of other people? What kind of practical advice do you think can be derived from this passage so that people can live better, happier, and more meaningful lives?",
