    "turn_text": "What a beautiful structure. I imagine if people just said, I'm going to commit myself to learning more of the Bible today than I knew yesterday, and I'm going to surround myself with people who I will respect, who I will listen to and who will see to, who will also derive their wisdom from the same principles. It would just be a much better and happier life if people did exactly that.",
