    "turn_idx": 26,
    "turn_text": "And so much of our, particularly in Western society and civilization, so much of our legal system is built on these things. They are. I mean, the fact of the matter is that people forget that, but I mean, we have virtually all of the 10 commandments at some point. for the most part, have been things that are reflected in our legal system, some straight out.",
