        "text": "Moral values shape societal institutions even when they aren't legally mandated.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "People generally value filial piety and care for elders due to cultural or ethical norms.",
        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "Economic rationality alone cannot explain complex social welfare systems.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker believes moral reasoning should inform public policy evaluation.",
